{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32587","headline":"江行书事 · 刘沧","name":"江行书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远渚蒹葭覆绿苔，姑苏南望思裴徊。\n空江独树楚山背，暮雨一舟吴苑来。\n人度深秋风叶落，鸟飞残照水烟开。\n寒潮欲上泛萍藻，寄荐三闾情自哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}